sequenceDiagram
 participant F as Frontend
 participant G as Gateway
 participant C as VerifyPayment
 participant R as Repository
 participant B as Proxy
 F->>G: POST verify mismo hash
 G->>C: execute
 C->>C: Canonizar hash
 C->>R: get(id)
 R-->>C: CONFIRMED y mismo hash
 C-->>G: Devolver orden existente
 Note over C,B: No consulta al proveedor
 Note over C,R: No hace otro commit
 G-->>F: HTTP 201, misma orden
